---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Transparency" description="Request and correction transparency log for streisandeffect.org.">
  <section class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Transparency</p>
    <h1>Requests, corrections, and changes</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The archive records takedown requests, correction requests, material metadata changes, and file replacements when publishing that information is safe and lawful.
    </p>
    <p class="last-reviewed">Last updated: 2026-08-26</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section metadata-panel">
    <h2>Current log summary</h2>
    <table class="meta-table">
      <tbody>
        <tr><th>Requests received</th><td>0</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Open requests</th><td>0</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Files replaced</th><td>0</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Downloads disabled</th><td>0</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose">
    <h2>Incident fields</h2>
    <p>When a request is received and can be safely disclosed, the log records:</p>
    <ul class="kicker-list">
      <li>Date received.</li>
      <li>Request category.</li>
      <li>Material affected.</li>
      <li>Requested action.</li>
      <li>Archive response.</li>
      <li>Current status.</li>
      <li>Whether identifying details were withheld for privacy or safety.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
